   ],
   "analysis": "<p>在本段中,作者指出&quot;给了饼干之后,你就不用去理它了,无视就好。&quot;也就是说,作者认为没必要强求自己去喜欢狗狗。选项1、选项3表示推断,排除。选项2使用「ばよかった」表示&quot;如果当时...就好了&quot;,不符合题意。所以答案是选项4。</p><p><br/></p><p>参考译文：</p><p><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 以下是在一</span>-本叫做《生活万事帮》的书里出现的提问及回答。</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">问</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">70</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">讨厌狗</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">丈夫</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">家</span>(婆婆家)因为喜欢大型犬所以在家里放养了大型犬。但我讨厌大型犬。以前</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">母亲说过</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">“</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">靠近狗会被咬</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">”</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。或许</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">是由于</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">狗看穿了我</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">对其他人都是发出哼哼的声音</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">唯独对我叫个不停。</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">或许</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">我</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">不是一个合格的家庭成员吧。</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">虽然只是普通的狗</span>,却</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">让</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">我倍感压力。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">答</span>70</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">用狗饼干驯服狗</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">以前有一个著名的实验，叫做</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">巴浦洛夫的狗。</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">在这个试验中，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">响铃之后给狗饲料</span>,这样反重复</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">多次</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">之后，最终</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">即便</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">不给饲料，狗</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">听到铃声</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">后也</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">会流口水。应用这个理论。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">到</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">宠物商店买看上去很可口的狗饼干吧。然后去婆婆家</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">的时候</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">一定要把狗饼干藏在口袋里</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">带</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">去。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">在此基础上，你应该采取即使被狂吠也</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">不要乱动</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">的态度</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。不要</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">缩</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">回</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">手，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">不要</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">大叫</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">着</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">逃跑。你</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">的举动都</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">被狗监视着。</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">虽然这么说，但</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">也不能直视狗的眼睛。因为狗会</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">认为收到了威胁</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。在这方面，人类的常识是行不通的。</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">不对视，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">那</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">是狗</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">的</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">礼貌</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">那么，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">即使被狗狂吠也</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">保持不动</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">一边不与狗对视</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">一边将</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">放</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">了</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">狗饼干</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">掌心伸</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">出去。</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">因为</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">这样</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">不会碰到狗的牙齿，所以</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">没有</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">用手捏</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">着</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">饼干喂给狗那么恐怖。今后</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，每次你</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">遇到那只狗，就喂它吃狗狗饼干。在</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">一次次的重复</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">过程中，狗狗会学到</span>“你=饼干’这件事，不久就会流着口水迎接你了吧。</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">以</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">上</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">就</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">是对讨厌狗的朋友</span>,</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">如何面对狂吠不止的</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">的狗可以尝试的办法。</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">虽然狗现在还会对着你狂吠的话，那就是</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">想要狗饼干</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">的叫声</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，只要得到饼干就会立刻变得老实</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">你明白</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">了</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">这个道理，也</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">就</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">不</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">会</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">再怕狗了。给了饼干后你就不用管它了。就像有人喜欢狗有人不喜欢狗，也没什么大不了的。</span></p><p><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br/></p>",
